{
  "_comment": [
    "Phase 4. The four panels the phase plan names - per-provider latency",
    "distribution, error rate, breaker state, bulkhead saturation - plus egress",
    "limiter shedding, because it is alerted on and an alert with no panel",
    "behind it leaves the responder with nothing to look at.",
    "",
    "The panels are deliberately the same series the alerts fire on. If the",
    "dashboard and the alert read different metrics they can disagree, and the",
    "person holding the pager finds out during the incident.",
    "",
    "Written as a file rather than clicked together in the UI so it survives a",
    "`signoz.sh destroy`, which is a normal thing to do to a 4 GB ClickHouse on",
    "a laptop. Applied by `tools/obs/signoz.sh apply`.",
    "",
    "Keys beginning with _ are stripped before POST - the v2 dashboard API",
    "rejects unknown fields outright rather than ignoring them."
  ],
  "schemaVersion": "v6",
  "_name_comment": [
    "Top-level `name` is REQUIRED, is an RFC 1123 label (lowercase, hyphens - a",
    "slug, not a title), and is absent from the published v2 example, which",
    "shows only spec.display.name. Without it every POST fails with a bare",
    "'name is required' that points at nothing - and since the API rejects",
    "unknown fields outright, guessing costs a round trip each time.",
    "schemaVersion v6 and layouts[].kind = Grid are missing from that example",
    "too. spec.display.name below is the human-readable title."
  ],
  "name": "payments-resilience",
  "tags": [
    { "key": "phase", "value": "4" },
    { "key": "owner", "value": "payorch" }
  ],
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "Payments - Resilience",
      "description": "Provider latency, error rate, breaker state and admission control. The series here are the ones the phase-4 alerts fire on."
    },
    "variables": [],
    "layouts": [
      {
        "kind": "Grid",
        "spec": {
          "items": [
            { "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 6, "height": 6, "content": { "$ref": "#/spec/panels/provider-latency" } },
            { "x": 6, "y": 0, "width": 6, "height": 6, "content": { "$ref": "#/spec/panels/error-rate" } },
            { "x": 0, "y": 6, "width": 6, "height": 6, "content": { "$ref": "#/spec/panels/breaker-state" } },
            { "x": 6, "y": 6, "width": 6, "height": 6, "content": { "$ref": "#/spec/panels/bulkhead-saturation" } },
            { "x": 0, "y": 12, "width": 12, "height": 6, "content": { "$ref": "#/spec/panels/ratelimit-shedding" } }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "provider-latency": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Provider latency — rolling P99 / P50 (ms)",
            "description": "From RollingLatency's merged histogram buckets, per provider and operation. This is the number phase 5 routes on. -1 means no calls in the window, which is not the same as fast."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "signoz/TimeSeriesPanel",
            "spec": {
              "visualization": { "timePreference": "global_time" },
              "legend": { "position": "bottom" }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "time_series",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "signoz/CompositeQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "queries": [
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "A",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 30,
                          "legend": "p99 {{psp}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.provider.latency.p99", "timeAggregation": "max", "spaceAggregation": "max" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "psp" }, { "name": "operation" }]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "B",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 30,
                          "legend": "p50 {{psp}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.provider.latency.p50", "timeAggregation": "max", "spaceAggregation": "max" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "psp" }, { "name": "operation" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },

      "error-rate": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Payment outcomes (% failed, and counts)",
            "description": "FAILED as a share of payments reaching a terminal state. NOT an HTTP error rate: during a chaos run with the provider failing 90% of calls the edge returned 9,323 x 201 and zero 5xx, because a decline is a business outcome rather than a transport error. UNKNOWN is plotted separately and deliberately excluded from the percentage - it is a payment that may have been charged, which is a different and more expensive problem than a decline."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "signoz/TimeSeriesPanel",
            "spec": {
              "visualization": { "timePreference": "global_time" },
              "legend": { "position": "bottom" }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "time_series",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "signoz/CompositeQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "queries": [
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "A",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.payment.outcome", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "filter": { "expression": "state = 'FAILED'" }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "B",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": true,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.payment.outcome", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_formula",
                        "spec": { "name": "F", "expression": "A/B*100", "legend": "failed %" }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "C",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "{{state}}/min",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.payment.outcome", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "state" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },

      "breaker-state": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Circuit breaker state",
            "description": "0 closed, 1 open, 2 half-open, per provider and operation. Plotted rather than payorch.breaker.failure.rate because that series is NaN below minimumCalls and therefore absent exactly when a breaker is idle."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "signoz/TimeSeriesPanel",
            "spec": {
              "visualization": { "timePreference": "global_time" },
              "legend": { "position": "bottom" }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "time_series",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "signoz/CompositeQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "queries": [
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "A",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 30,
                          "legend": "{{psp}}:{{operation}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.breaker.state", "timeAggregation": "max", "spaceAggregation": "max" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "psp" }, { "name": "operation" }]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "B",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "refused/min {{psp}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.breaker.calls.not.permitted", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "psp" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },

      "bulkhead-saturation": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Bulkhead — shed vs admitted per minute",
            "description": "Rejections are not bad news: shed work is the point. The failure this component prevents does not appear as a rejection, it appears as a heap dump. Free permits are on the same panel so saturation is visible as the gap closing."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "signoz/TimeSeriesPanel",
            "spec": {
              "visualization": { "timePreference": "global_time" },
              "legend": { "position": "bottom" }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "time_series",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "signoz/CompositeQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "queries": [
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "A",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "rejected/min {{service.name}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.bulkhead.rejected", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "service.name" }]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "B",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "permitted/min {{service.name}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.bulkhead.permitted", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "service.name" }]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "C",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 30,
                          "legend": "permits free {{service.name}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.bulkhead.available.total", "timeAggregation": "min", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "service.name" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },

      "ratelimit-shedding": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate limiters — rejections per minute by layer",
            "description": "Three layers, three different pages. merchant: one caller is over their allowance. endpoint: this service is at capacity. egress: we are about to breach a provider's contract. Reporting them as one number would make all three unactionable."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "signoz/TimeSeriesPanel",
            "spec": {
              "visualization": { "timePreference": "global_time" },
              "legend": { "position": "bottom" }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "time_series",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "signoz/CompositeQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "queries": [
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "A",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "{{layer}} @ {{service.name}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.ratelimit.rejected", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "layer" }, { "name": "service.name" }]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "builder_query",
                        "spec": {
                          "name": "B",
                          "signal": "metrics",
                          "disabled": false,
                          "stepInterval": 60,
                          "legend": "fail-open {{service.name}}",
                          "aggregations": [
                            { "metricName": "payorch.ratelimit.store.failures", "timeAggregation": "increase", "spaceAggregation": "sum" }
                          ],
                          "groupBy": [{ "name": "service.name" }]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
